    "name": "TOTAL ZUGZWANG",
    "steam_appid": 2879310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Prepare To Join The New Chess Legacy</h1><p><i><strong>Old Chess Theory can be thrown out the window. Invent your own way to play and mark your name in the new Chess legacy!</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/9e2e2b159ed0d827dcf577a4898c4399.avif?t=1731264625\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><br><h1>DEFINITIONS</h1><p><strong>ZUGZWANG</strong> - <i>/\u02c8\u02a6u\u02d0k\u02a6va\u014b/ n.</i> <strong>1.</strong> The compulsion to move. <br><strong>2.</strong> In the game of chess it denotes a position in which the obligation to move a piece on the board has grave consequences.<br><br><strong>TOTAL ZUGZWANG</strong> - <i>/\u02c8t\u0259\u028atl \u02c8\u02a6u\u02d0k\u02a6va\u014b/ n.</i> In the game <i>&quot;TOTAL ZUGZWANG&quot;</i> it denotes the special event in which there is an obligation to move every piece, the very board itself, and bear the consequences.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Chess has been given an upgrade.</strong> This unique roguelike challenge integrates the chess board with a steam-powered conveyor belt, and puts it in a machine that ceaselessly spits out procedurally generated waves of chess armies, dangerous traps and powerful items.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategise to defeat cunning Kings, while protecting your flank against brutish rogue pieces. <br></li><li>Resurrect fallen pawns and promote them to build your battalion of Queens. <br></li><li>Survive into the end game and defeat the final mechanical terror.<br></li><li>Battle for highscores against your friends and the world!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;THE INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION HAS MODERNISED THE ANCIENT GAME OF CHESS&quot;</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/68eaae9db0043dbf6b1afe2eb30e906f.poster.avif?t=1731264625\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/68eaae9db0043dbf6b1afe2eb30e906f.webm?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/68eaae9db0043dbf6b1afe2eb30e906f.mp4?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME-CHANGING POWERUPS</h2>Fight for dominance of pivotal squares to capture <strong>power-ups with board-shattering effects</strong> and turn the tides of battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/810149e7bb9bc512749637b269ba9984.poster.avif?t=1731264625\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/810149e7bb9bc512749637b269ba9984.webm?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/810149e7bb9bc512749637b269ba9984.mp4?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHECKMATE OR BE CHECKMATED</h2>With every grind of the conveyor belt, every shift of the board, every <i><strong>TOTAL ZUGZWANG</strong></i>, <br>you could find yourself one move from a <strong>gratifying checkmate</strong>...<br>...or one away from <strong>your own King's game-ending capture</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/9b06a6389c951d1182d350cde4f3101a.poster.avif?t=1731264625\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/9b06a6389c951d1182d350cde4f3101a.webm?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/9b06a6389c951d1182d350cde4f3101a.mp4?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRIBE AND SELL TO ALTER THE BATTLEFIELD IN YOUR FAVOR</h2>Use captured pieces as currency to <strong>bribe brutish rogues to join your side</strong>.<br>Boost your score and declutter the board by <strong>selling pieces no longer needed</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/3306e632bb8d572e78b955bcc3e07b4d.poster.avif?t=1731264625\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/3306e632bb8d572e78b955bcc3e07b4d.webm?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879310/extras/3306e632bb8d572e78b955bcc3e07b4d.mp4?t=1731264625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHESS COME ALIVE WITH SOUND AND MUSIC BY JAKE GAULE [SUBMERGED TAPES]</h2>Be immersed in the machinery through a textured steampunk soundscape.<br>Become transfixed to the action with an original procedural soundtrack of hypnotic african drumming interspersed with electrifying trumpets performed by John Robert Matz.",
